<title>SINGAPORE: SIA 1996/97 net profit up 0.6 percent.</title>
<headline>SIA 1996/97 net profit up 0.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>For year ended March 31 1997</p>
<p>(in million of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 1,031.5  vs  1,025.3</p>
<p>    Group share  (cents)	80.4  vs     79.9</p>
<p>    Final dividend (pct)	15.0  vs     15.0</p>
<p>    Bonus dividend (pct)	 7.5  vs	nil</p>
<p>    Turnover		   7,221.5  vs  6,889.9</p>
<p>    Total expenditure	6,325.8  vs  5,844.9</p>
<p>    Operating profit	   895.7  vs  1,045.0</p>
<p>    Pretax		     1,075.7  vs  1,081.7</p>
<p>Note- Singapore Airlines Ltd said the bonus dividend was to celebrate its 50th anniversary.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
